# Project structure

```
design/     Design explorations — one self-contained subfolder per direction (static HTML/CSS or a full standalone app prototype)
web/        Production website — full tech stack, build config, deployable app
assets/     Shared docs and raw media (NOT web/public)
.cursor/    Agent rules
```

- Put new design directions in `design/<name>/`. A direction may be simple static HTML/CSS or a full standalone app prototype (its own `package.json`, deps, and build) — but it must stay self-contained inside its subfolder.
- Implement the chosen site in `web/`. Runtime public assets go in `web/`'s own public/static path.
- Store strategy docs in `assets/docs/`, images in `assets/images/`. Copy into `web/` when the site needs them.
